# ENT enterprise DB packages

Node calls **one package per domain** via `ENT_MODULE_PACKAGES` in `shared/entDbClient.js`.

Package and view DDL live in **Oracle** (not in repo). Org units package SQL remains in `org_units/sql/`.

## Package map

| Module | Package |
|--------|---------|
| Shared JSON | `ENT_JSON_UTIL_PKG` |
| Stats | `ENT_STATS_PKG` |
| Enterprises | `ENT_ENTERPRISES_PKG` |
| Structure levels | `ENT_STRUCTURE_LEVELS_PKG` |
| Org units | `ORG_UNITS_PKG` |
| Job families | `ENT_JOB_FAMILIES_PKG` |
| Grades | `ENT_GRADES_PKG` |
| Job levels | `ENT_JOB_LEVELS_PKG` |
| Positions | `ENT_POSITIONS_PKG` |
| HR structures | `ENT_HR_ORG_STRUCTURES_PKG` |
| HR hierarchy | `ENT_HR_ORG_HIERARCHY_LEVELS_PKG` |

Read views: `shared/entViews.js` (`ENT.V_*`)

## Repo SQL

`org_units/sql/ENT_ORG_UNITS_PKG_*.sql` only.

## Node layer

See `.cursor/rules/ent-enterprise-node-thin.mdc`
